'''Yuletide Nurse''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Xmas Gals (Gacha Event)|Xmas Gals]] gacha event. She is an anti-[[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|Angel]]/[[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|Alien]] variant of [[Nurse Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Nurse Cat]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]] increases her HP and adds [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] targeting. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]].

